      "comment": "From <span lang=\"la\">diurna</span>, the daily record (<span lang=\"la\">ācta diurna</span>). Lewis &amp; Short has the word once, late, for a keeper of a day-book (Cod. Theod. 8.4.8). A woman is <span lang=\"la\">diurnāria</span> (Traupman). Traupman gives the same word for a reporter."
    },
