        "M-O s.v. reporter (Egger)"
      ],
      "comment": "Classically the mover of a motion in the senate (Balbus in Cic. Att. 8.15a.2), late a narrator; an inscription names a recorder of auctions (Lewis &amp; Short)."
    },
